      "statement": "All markdown files pass through a four-stage preprocessing pipeline: cross-reference resolution (@[LinkName] → links), conditional rendering (:::python/:::js blocks), link rewriting (OSS versioning, Managed Deep Agents routing, snippet redirection), and UTM/edit link addition.",
